{"t": "Entwickler-API", "b": "<h1 id=\"entwickler-api\">Entwickler-API<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#entwickler-api\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h1>\n<p>OmniGuard stellt einen typisierten Service im <code>ServicesManager</code> von Bukkit bereit, dazu Bukkit-Events. Ein vollständiges, kompilierbares Beispiel-Plugin\nliegt in <a href=\"https://github.com/plisquante/OmniGuard/tree/main/examples/api-example\"><code>examples/api-example</code></a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"einrichtung\">Einrichtung<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#einrichtung\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Füge die OmniGuard-Jar deinem Compile-Classpath hinzu (Scope <code>provided</code> / <code>compileOnly</code>) und deklariere die Abhängigkeit:</p>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"c1\"># plugin.yml</span>\n<span class=\"nt\">depend</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p p-Indicator\">[</span><span class=\"nv\">OmniGuard</span><span class=\"p p-Indicator\">]</span><span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\"># or softdepend</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">OmniGuardService</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bukkit</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getServicesManager</span><span class=\"p\">().</span><span class=\"na\">load</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">OmniGuardService</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">class</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">null</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// OmniGuard not installed</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<div class=\"callout warn\">\n<p>Verwende nur Klassen aus <code>dev.omniguard.api</code> und <code>dev.omniguard.api.event</code>. Alles andere ist intern und kann sich ändern.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"omniguardservice\">OmniGuardService<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#omniguardservice\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Methode</th>\n<th>Beschreibung</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>version()</code></td>\n<td>Plugin-Version</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isAttackMode()</code> / <code>setAttackMode(\"auto\"\\|\"on\"\\|\"off\")</code></td>\n<td>Angriffsmodus</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isMonitorMode()</code></td>\n<td>Nur-Erkennen-Modus</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isLockdown()</code> / <code>setLockdown(boolean)</code></td>\n<td>Lockdown</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>stats()</code></td>\n<td><code>StatsSnapshot(packets, blocked, kicks, refusedConnections, dupes, packetsPerSecond, blockedPerSecond, trackedItems)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>checks()</code></td>\n<td>Map von Check-ID → aktiviert</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>getViolationLevel(uuid, checkId)</code> / <code>getViolations(uuid)</code></td>\n<td>Aktuelle Verstoß-Level</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>exempt(uuid, checkId, Duration)</code></td>\n<td>Vorübergehende Ausnahme von einem Check, oder <code>\"*\"</code> für alle</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>clearExemptions(uuid)</code> / <code>isExempt(uuid, checkId)</code></td>\n<td>Ausnahmen verwalten</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>reportViolation(player, source, detail, amount)</code></td>\n<td>Eigene Erkennungen in OmniGuards Alarme, Discord, Logs und die Strafen des <code>external</code>-Checks einspeisen</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>getLinkedAccounts(name)</code></td>\n<td>Konten, die eine IP geteilt haben</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>getItemIdentity(item)</code></td>\n<td>Ledger-Identität eines Items</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>trackItem(item)</code></td>\n<td>Einem Item sofort eine Identität geben (z. B. Crate-Belohnungen); auf dem Thread aufrufen, dem das Item gehört</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>getCustody(uuid)</code></td>\n<td>Besitzkette (<code>CustodyStep(timeMillis, holder)</code>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>isCompromised(uuid)</code></td>\n<td>Ob die Identität als dupliziert bestätigt wurde</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<p>Alle Methoden außer <code>trackItem</code> sind thread-sicher. Unbekannte Check-IDs werfen <code>IllegalArgumentException</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"beispiele\">Beispiele<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#beispiele\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"einen-spieler-wahrend-deines-sprungfelds-ausnehmen\">Einen Spieler während deines Sprungfelds ausnehmen<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#einen-spieler-wahrend-deines-sprungfelds-ausnehmen\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">exempt</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">player</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getUniqueId</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"invalid-movement\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Duration</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">ofSeconds</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n<span class=\"n\">player</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">setVelocity</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">new</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Vector</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h3 id=\"eigene-erkennung-melden\">Eigene Erkennung melden<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#eigene-erkennung-melden\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">reportViolation</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">player</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"MyAntiCheat\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"reach 6.2 blocks\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">1.0</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h3 id=\"crate-belohnungen-verfolgen\">Crate-Belohnungen verfolgen<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#crate-belohnungen-verfolgen\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h3>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">ItemStack</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">reward</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">new</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ItemStack</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Material</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">NETHERITE_SWORD</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"n\">UUID</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">og</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">trackItem</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">reward</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"n\">player</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getInventory</span><span class=\"p\">().</span><span class=\"na\">addItem</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">reward</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"events\">Events<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#events\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Event</th>\n<th>Abbrechbar</th>\n<th>Wann</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OmniGuardViolationEvent</code></td>\n<td>ja (unterdrückt Alarm und Strafe)</td>\n<td>Jeder fehlgeschlagene Check</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OmniGuardPunishEvent</code></td>\n<td>ja (Strafe selbst übernehmen)</td>\n<td>Direkt vor einem Kick oder Strafbefehlen</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OmniGuardDupeEvent</code></td>\n<td>ja (keine Beschlagnahme, kein Alarm)</td>\n<td>Ein Duplikat wurde bestätigt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OmniGuardAttackModeEvent</code></td>\n<td>nein</td>\n<td>Angriffsmodus beginnt oder endet</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<div class=\"callout warn\">\n<p>Verstoß- und Straf-Events können <strong>asynchron</strong> sein, weil Paket-Checks auf Netty-Threads laufen. Nutze den Scheduler, bevor du die Welt anfasst. Abbrechen lässt das bösartige Paket nie durch.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hl\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"nd\">@EventHandler</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">onPunish</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">OmniGuardPunishEvent</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getCheckId</span><span class=\"p\">().</span><span class=\"na\">equals</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"packet-rate\"</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">setCancelled</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kc\">true</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"w\">                         </span><span class=\"c1\">// no kick from OmniGuard…</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">jail</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">send</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getPlayerId</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">getDetail</span><span class=\"p\">());</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// …your own handling</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"statischer-helfer\">Statischer Helfer<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#statischer-helfer\" title=\"Permanent link\">#</a></h2>\n<p><code>OmniGuardAPI</code> (statisch) gibt es weiterhin für schnelle Abfragen: <code>isAttackMode()</code>, <code>getViolationLevel(...)</code>,\n<code>getBlockedCount(...)</code>, <code>getItemIdentity(...)</code> und <code>service()</code>, das den vollständigen <code>OmniGuardService</code> zurückgibt.</p>", "c": "<a href=\"#einrichtung\">Einrichtung</a><a href=\"#omniguardservice\">OmniGuardService</a><a href=\"#beispiele\">Beispiele</a><a href=\"#events\">Events</a><a href=\"#statischer-helfer\">Statischer Helfer</a>"}